  "translation": "Xiao Ming and Xiao Li are good friends. They plan to go to the park together this weekend. Xiao Ming asks Xiao Li, \"When will we go?\" Xiao Li says, \"How about Saturday morning at eight o'clock?\" Xiao Ming thinks this time will be good. They agree to meet at the park entrance. That day the weather is very good, neither cold nor hot. They walk in the park for a long time. Xiao Ming sees many flowers, very beautiful. Xiao Li says, \"Let's find a place to sit and rest.\" They sit under a tree chatting happily. In the afternoon, they go to eat lunch together. They have a lot of fun. Xiao Ming says, \"Next time we'll come together again.\""
